# --- Alembic (once migrations are introduced -- see docs/architecture.md's
# "Known architectural limitations" -- versions themselves should still be
# committed, only local scratch state should not be) -------------------
# alembic/versions/*.pyc

# --- Local database / logs -------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.log

# --- Generated experiment artifacts (Section 21/22) ------------------------
# `ExperimentManager`/`ExperimentConfig.save()`/`ReproducibilityManifest.save()`
# and the test suite all write real run output under experiments/ -- none of
# it is source and all of it is reproducible from a config + seed, so none of
# it belongs in version control. Curated, hand-written summaries
# (results/research/FINDINGS.md, STATISTICAL_ANALYSIS.md,
# results/ablation/FINDINGS.md) are the exception and stay tracked.
experiments/configs/
experiments/results/checkpoints/
experiments/results/manifests/
experiments/results/*.json
experiments/results/research/*.json
experiments/results/ablation/*.json
!experiments/results/research/FINDINGS.md
!experiments/results/research/STATISTICAL_ANALYSIS.md
!experiments/results/ablation/FINDINGS.md

# --- Model artifacts (Demo Agent -- PPO checkpoints, Section 4) -----------
# Covered by experiments/results/checkpoints/ above; anything else ending in
# .zip in this backend is also a generated SB3 checkpoint, never source.
*.zip